{"id":"85f5bd5a74d00452","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-alg-monoid.md","title":"ZFC Alg Monoid","display":"df-zfc-alg-monoid — ZFC Alg Monoid","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-alg-monoid","aliases":["58-df-zfc-alg-monoid"],"display":"df-zfc-alg-monoid — ZFC Alg Monoid","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-product.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-alg-monoid"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-alg-monoid</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-alg-monoid — ZFC Alg Monoid"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md\">../batch19/58-df-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-product.md\">../batch10/58-df-product.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ast\">\\(\\ast\\)</span> (candidate set-coded binary operation; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ast y\">\\(x\\ast y\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ast(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(\\ast(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> (candidate identity element)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoid}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoid}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (ternary predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}monoid} \\vdash \\operatorname{Monoid}(M,\\ast,e)\\leftrightarrow \\ast\\in M^{M\\times M}\\land e\\in M\\land \\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in M\\;((x\\ast y)\\ast z=x\\ast(y\\ast z))\\bigr)\\land \\bigl(\\forall x\\in M\\;(e\\ast x=x\\land x\\ast e=x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}monoid} \\vdash \\operatorname{Monoid}(M,\\ast,e)\\leftrightarrow \\ast\\in M^{M\\times M}\\land e\\in M\\land \\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in M\\;((x\\ast y)\\ast z=x\\ast(y\\ast z))\\bigr)\\land \\bigl(\\forall x\\in M\\;(e\\ast x=x\\land x\\ast e=x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A monoid is a set with an associative binary operation and a two-sided identity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-product.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\ast","display":false},{"tex":"x\\ast y","display":false},{"tex":"\\ast(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoid}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}monoid} \\vdash \\operatorname{Monoid}(M,\\ast,e)\\leftrightarrow \\ast\\in M^{M\\times M}\\land e\\in M\\land \\bigl(\\forall x,y,z\\in M\\;((x\\ast y)\\ast z=x\\ast(y\\ast z))\\bigr)\\land \\bigl(\\forall x\\in M\\;(e\\ast x=x\\land x\\ast e=x)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":965,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1416","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-alg-monoid.md|58-df-zfc-alg-monoid]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97","36d7463d215be751","3579e07be41aa5cd"]}